          "path": "_m/g/c/t/b/crosby-merseyside-wp/strange-sculpture-geograph-org.jpg",
          "filename": "Strange Sculpture - geograph.org.uk - 1801538.jpg",
          "caption": "Strange Sculpture Walking up the Crosby to Hightown path I spotted this sculpture. The previous day, I'd been to Llanddulas in North Wales and my Uncle told me about an Irish man who'd recently been to their beach creating sculptures from pebbles, sadly washed away by a recent high tide. He said he was working his way around the coast doing more of them. I wonder if this is his work?",
          "alt": "Strange Sculpture Walking up the Crosby to Hightown path I spotted this sculpture. The previous day, I'd been to Llanddulas in North Wales and my Uncle told me about an Irish man who'd recently been to their beach creating sculptures from pebbles, sadly washed away by a recent high tide. He said he was working his way around the coast doing more of them. I wonder if this is his work?",
